1393-tmux server generation, provider build, and macOS version. Aqua alone and
1394-sentinel-only evidence are insufficient. Any provider flow requiring GUI
1395-interaction, Keychain UI, a permission prompt, or other human action fails
1396-closed until that interaction succeeds in the verified GUI realm.
1397-
1398-After restore, the wrapper MUST:
1399-
1400-1. read the latest locally known lease;
1401:2. attempt a mesh lease refresh without blocking forever;
1402-3. resume locally only if the local host has the winning lease and the required
1403-   materialization is valid;
1404-4. offer remote attach/takeover when another host owns the session in an
1405-   interactive terminal; or
1406-5. enter <code>parked</code> without launching the provider in all other cases.
1407-
1408-Logout or reboot invalidates unrenewed realm evidence. Without a verified GUI
1409-realm, recovery MUST remain parked until GUI login re-establishes the broker,
--
1953-
1954-An owner process MUST revalidate its fencing token before:
1955-
1956-- accepting operator input after attach;
1957-- starting a provider turn;
1958-- publishing a checkpoint;
1959-- pushing records or workspace changes; and
1960-- resuming after any transport or sleep interruption longer than the configured
1961:  lease refresh interval.
1962-
1963-There is no time-expiring ownership lease in v0.5.0. Liveness is not authority.
1964-A host being offline does not make a replica owner; only a takeover or fork
1965-does.
1966-
1967-### 5.4 Checkpoint Record
1968-
1969-The Checkpoint Record schema is <code>urn:ax:schema:checkpoint</code> version
--
7186-| <code>chunks.put</code> | Submit one base64url chunk with descriptor |
7187-| <code>transfer.validate</code> | Assemble blobs and validate the complete manifest |
7188-| <code>transfer.commit</code> | Atomically install immutable objects; does not materialize a workspace |
7189-| <code>materialize.prepare</code> | Run destination conflict and capability checks |
7190-| <code>materialize.commit</code> | Install a validated transaction in rollbackable prepared state (the historical operation name is retained) |
7191-| <code>materialize.status</code> | Recover the exact durable materialization phase after a lost response or restart |
7192-| <code>materialize.finalize</code> | Finalize a prepared transaction after dormant validation or winning-owner resume |
7193-| <code>materialize.rollback</code> | Restore the pre-commit managed destination |
7194:| <code>lease.refresh</code> | Exchange lease heads and return the deterministic winner |
7195-| <code>tombstone.ack</code> | Persist a peer acknowledgement |
7196-| <code>session.status</code> | Read authoritative lifecycle, process, checkpoint, and active-operation state for one session |
7197-| <code>session.stop</code> | Execute the owner-side stop transaction in Section 13.9 |
7198-| <code>handoff.prepare</code> | Reserve one graceful handoff against an expected source lease/checkpoint |
7199-| <code>handoff.quiesce</code> | Quiesce the source and return its validated bulk-sync checkpoint |
7200-| <code>handoff.stop</code> | Stop the source after destination validation and return any superseding closure checkpoint |
7201-| <code>handoff.commit</code> | Persist the destination Lease Record on the source and park the old owner |
7202-| <code>handoff.abort</code> | Abort a pre-lease handoff and explicitly unquiesce or retain stopped state |
--
7309-| <code>chunks.put</code> | <code>{initiator_host_id:UUIDv7,transfer_id:UUIDv7,descriptor:Transfer Chunk Descriptor,data:base64url}</code> | <code>{transfer_id:UUIDv7,chunk_id:digest,verified:boolean}</code> |
7310-| <code>transfer.validate</code> | <code>{initiator_host_id:UUIDv7,transfer_id:UUIDv7,manifest_id:digest}</code> | <code>{transfer_id:UUIDv7,manifest_id:digest,valid:boolean,verified_blob_count:uint53,verified_object_count:uint53,validation_summary_digest:digest}</code> |
7311-| <code>transfer.commit</code> | <code>{initiator_host_id:UUIDv7,transfer_id:UUIDv7,manifest_id:digest,validation_summary_digest:digest}</code> | <code>{transfer_id:UUIDv7,installed_object_ids:sorted unique digest[1..65536],commit_marker_id:digest}</code> |
